  'Kamera rusak karena instrumen menyala saat badai matahari. Navigator: matikan instrumen (I) saat Spesialis melihat badai di radar, atau pasang Pelindung radiasi.': 'The camera was damaged because the instruments were on during a solar storm. Navigator: turn the instruments off (I) when the Specialist sees a storm on the radar, or install the Radiation shield.',
