  'Spesialis: tekan Kirim foto sebelum waktu di permukaan habis.': 'Specialist: press Send photo before surface time runs out.', 'Wahana terlalu berat untuk roket besar. Kurangi bahan bakar atau item di Rakit.': 'The craft is too heavy for the large rocket. Remove fuel or items on the Build screen.',
  // Fakta dan misi nyata
  'Di Biak, Papua, ada stasiun bumi milik BRIN (dulu LAPAN) untuk melacak satelit, mengirim perintah, dan menerima datanya. Karena dekat khatulistiwa, satelit yang orbitnya sejajar khatulistiwa, seperti LAPAN-A#, melintas di atasnya hampir setiap putaran. Stasiun ini juga membantu memantau peluncuran roket India (ISRO).': 'In Biak, Papua, there is a ground station run by BRIN (formerly LAPAN) that tracks satellites, sends commands, and receives their data. Because it is near the equator, satellites in near-equatorial orbits, such as LAPAN-A#, pass over it on almost every orbit. The station also helps track Indian (ISRO) rocket launches.',
